# GRC & Cybersecurity Compliance Portfolio

Welcome to my cybersecurity and GRC portfolio.

This repository demonstrates practical implementations of information security governance, risk management, compliance, and audit activities based on real-world industry practices.

## Frameworks

- ISO 27001:2022
- SOC 2 Type II
- NIST Cybersecurity Framework
- HIPAA
- PCI DSS

## Project

### SecureCloud Technologies

A fictional SaaS organization implementing an Information Security Management System (ISMS) and preparing for ISO 27001 certification and SOC 2 compliance.

## Repository Structure

- Company Profile
- Asset Inventory
- Risk Assessment
- Statement of Applicability
- Security Policies
- Internal Audit
- Vendor Risk Management
- Business Continuity
- Incident Response
- Power BI Dashboard
- Executive Reports

> This portfolio is intended for educational and professional demonstration purposes.
